# Purpose

This document defines the monitoring engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish consistent principles for evaluating platform health, operational stability, and service reliability while enabling engineering teams to detect, understand, and respond to meaningful operational changes.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Monitoring philosophy
* Platform health
* Service reliability
* Operational awareness
* Monitoring governance
* Monitoring evolution

It intentionally excludes monitoring platforms, metrics systems, dashboards, alerting technologies, tracing, and implementation-specific monitoring solutions, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to operational monitoring, ensuring platform health remains measurable, understandable, and aligned with business objectives.

